<NTAccordion class="docs-fill" LimitToOneExpanded="true" GroupName="faq-single" Variant="NTAccordionVariant.Outlined">
    <NTAccordionItem Label="How do I reset my password?" Open="true">
        <p>Select Forgot password on the sign-in page and we will email you a reset link that stays valid for one hour.</p>
    </NTAccordionItem>
    <NTAccordionItem Label="Can I change my plan later?">
        <p>Yes. Upgrade or downgrade at any time from Billing; the difference is prorated on your next invoice.</p>
    </NTAccordionItem>
    <NTAccordionItem Label="Where can I download invoices?">
        <p>Every invoice is listed under Billing history as a PDF for the past 24 months.</p>
    </NTAccordionItem>
</NTAccordion>
<p>Opening an item closes the item that was open, so only one stays expanded.</p>
